-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",90,{
[2849]="7006B54E\n1\tFind your friends and crew in the Sail-haven, not far from the Beacon-gate on the west side of Umbar Baharbêl\tMany of your friends, including the crew of the Wave-hunter, prepare to depart Umbar Baharbêl from the Sail-haven. Jaith told you to find them not far from the Beacon-gate on the west side of the city.\n2\tTalk to Lady Nauriel in the Sail-haven\tLady Nauriel of Pinnath Gelin stands in the Sail-haven in Umbar Baharbêl, east of the Beacon-gate.\n3\tTalk to Thorongil in the Sail-haven\tThe child Thorongil stands by his mother in the Sail-haven in Umbar Baharbêl, east of the Beacon-gate.\n4\tTalk to Nimrodel in the Sail-haven\tNimrodel stands among your friends in the Sail-haven in Umbar Baharbêl, east of the Beacon-gate.\n5\tNimrodel's guardians are preparing to depart, and you should acknowledge them with a salute or a wave.\t\n6\tLegolas stands ready to depart for Gondor on a merchant vessel leaving Umbar Baharbêl.\t\n7\tTalk to Gimli in the Sail-haven\tGimli stands ready to depart for Gondor on a merchant vessel leaving Umbar Baharbêl.\n8\tTalk to Sirgon in the Sail-haven\tSirgon is not yet prepared to leave Umbar Baharbêl, and wishes to speak with you about the days to come.\n",
[2850]="70059ACF\n1\tReturn to Zul-mazal by the upper crypts on the western side of the Pit of Stonejaws\tZul-mazal is by the upper crypts on the western side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Stáli the Hewer in Zul-mazal\030Talk to Fastrith in Zul-mazal\030Talk to Bróin in Zul-mazal\tA number of Longbeards stand in Zul-mazal, studying the broken mosaic and the curious stone block in the centre of the chamber.\n3\tTalk to Durin in Zul-mazal\tDurin stands in Zul-mazal, deep in thought.\n",
[2851]="70059AD1\n1\tTalk to Durin and help him uncover the secret of Zul-mazal\tDurin is in Zul-mazal, determined to unravel whatever mystery lies within the curious chamber's walls.\n2\tTalk to Durin deep beneath Gundabad\tDurin stands beside a secret stair deep beneath Gundabad, marvelling at the long-hidden passage.\n",
[2852]="7006B551\n1\tTalk to Corudan in the Sail-haven\030Talk to Sigileth in the Sail-haven\tCorudan and Sigileth are in the Sail-haven, east of the Beacon-gate in Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tTalk to Sirgon in the Sail-haven and go with him to meet the Kindred\tSirgon is waiting in the Sail-haven east of the Beacon-gate to go with you to meet with the Kindred of the Coins.\n3\tTalk to Sirgon outside the Lords' Gate in the Fleetfast\tSirgon stands in the Fleetfast outside the Lords' Gate, waiting to discuss your meeting with the Kindred of the Coins.\n",
[2853]="70052760\n1\tTalk to Gandalf at the Beorninghús\tGandalf wishes to speak with you. The Wizard stands near the entrance to the Beorninghús.\n2\tClear brush from roads in the Beorning-lands near the Beorninghús (total: 8)\030Collect firewood in the Beorning-lands near the Beorninghús (total: 8)\030Search patches of soil for flint (total: 6)\030Defeat Orcs in the Beorning-lands (total: 8)\030Defeat wargs in the Beorning-lands (total: 6)\tGrimbeorn has tasked you with a number of errands to undertake in the Beorning-lands, and Gandalf has helpfully doubled the required quantities of each.\n3\tBring the useful pieces of flint to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús\tGrimbeorn is at the Beorninghús, in the Beorning-lands.\n",
[2854]="70059AD0\n1\tDescend the secret stairs far below Gundabad and explore the deepest caverns\tThe secret stairs have not been travelled for an age, descending far below Gundabad. What lies beyond their lowest step?\n2\tWait for Durin to catch up with you\tDurin runs into the long-forgotten chamber.\n3\tTalk to Durin in the long-forgotten chamber\tDurin stands in the long-forgotten chamber deep below Gundabad.\n4\tExamine the statue of Mótsog\tA statue of Mótsog stands in the long-forgotten chamber.\n5\tTalk to Durin in the long-forgotten chamber\tDurin stands in the long-forgotten chamber beneath Gundabad.\n6\tMeet up with Durin at the bottom of the stairs outside\tDurin has asked you to meet him on the stairs outside the long-forgotten chamber.\n7\tReturn to Durin and learn what has disturbed him\tSomething about the air feels different. But what?\n",
[2855]="7005275F\n1\tTalk to Gultheg at Vegbár\tGultheg is at Vegbár, the watch-fort west of the Old Ford in the Wolf-denes.\n2\tFind the entrance to the village of Hultvís, on the eastern side of Woodsedge\tHultvís is on the eastern side of Woodsedge, in the Vales of Anduin.\n3\tTalk to Adalfon at the entrance to Hultvís\tAdalfon has greeted you at the entrance to the village of Hultvís.\n4\tDefeat Orcs in Woodsedge (total: 6)\030Collect flanks from forest-harts in Woodsedge (total: 4)\tAdalfon asked you to help the village of Hultvís recover and rebuild following the recent battle.\n5\tBring the flanks to Veremund by the cooking fires in Hultvís\tYou hunted wild harts for the Woodmen of Hultvís, and now Veremund waits by the fires in the village for the meat you obtained.\n6\tTalk to Gelfrida in Hultvís\030Talk to Eurik in Hultvís\030Talk to Mavi in Hultvís\tTownsfolk throughout Hultvís will speak to you of the legends that have been passed down among the Woodmen.\n7\tTalk to Veremund by the cooking fires in Hultvís\tVeremund is by the cooking fires of Hultvís, waiting for you to return from speaking with the people of the village.\n8\tBring the collected tolls to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús\tGrimbeorn is at the Beorninghús, waiting for you to return with the collected tolls from Vegbár.\n9\tTalk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús\tGandalf is inside the Beorninghús, studying the Black Book of Mordor within Grimbeorn's lodge.\n",
[2856]="7006B552\n1\tTalk to Hármelak in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\tThe leaders of the Kindred await your assistance with their preparations in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja.\n2\tTalk to Belondor in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\030Talk to Khôltekh in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\030Talk to Rothog in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\tThe leaders of the Kindred await your assistance in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja.\n3\tDeliver Hármelak's orders to Jakbir at Bith Gabâr, the Forum in the Upper Ward\030Talk to Mêshka somewhere within the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\030Deliver Khôltekh's orders to Ilbidûn at Stonecliff Market in the Lower Ward\030Deliver Rothog's orders to Mekhamun on the steps of Dahâl Huliz in the Tor-gardens\tThe Kindred of the Coins have given you orders to deliver to a number of people at various locations within the city: Bith Gabâr, the forum in the Upper Ward, at Stonecliff Market in the Lower Ward, and on the steps of Dahâl Huliz, the arena in the Tor-gardens.\n4\tTalk to Sirgon by the east gate of Umbar Baharbêl\tSirgon is by the east gate of Umbar Baharbêl, preparing to depart the city.\n",
[2857]="7006B553\n1\tTalk to Caebar on a terrace west of the Arena in the Tor-gardens of Umbar Baharbêl\tCaebar is on a terrace west of the Arena in the Tor-gardens of Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tPick pigment berries from bushes down the steps to the east (total: 6)\tCaebar will teach you what he knows, but first he needs your help to finish the chores given to him by his instructor: picking berries from bushes down the steps to the east to be used for the making of inks and pigments.\n3\tBring the pigment berries to Caebar on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tCaebar is on a terrace west of the Arena in the Tor-gardens of Umbar Baharbêl, waiting for you to return with the pigment berries you picked.\n4\tFind Caebar's teacher Ghâlim at Kên Taghlim in Kamrabezûr, in Umbar-môkh\tCaebar's teacher, a man named Ghâlim, is at Kên Taghlim in Kamrabezûr, in Umbar-môkh.\n5\tTalk to Ghâlim at Kên Taghlim in Umbar-môkh\tGhâlim is at Kên Taghlim in Umbar-môkh.\n6\tRetrieve the book 'Kanash-tubu-hârra' from Harkhaphâr in Kamrabezûr, in Umbar-môkh\tGhâlim has asked you to retrieve the book 'Kanash-tubu-hârra' from Harkhaphâr, far to the south of Kamrabezûr, in Umbar-môkh.\n7\tBring 'Kanash-tubu-hârra' to Ghâlim at Kên Taghlim in Umbar-môkh\tGhâlim is at Kên Taghlim in Umbar-môkh.\n8\tTalk to Caebar on the terrace west of the Arena in the Tor-gardens\tCaebar is on the terrace west of the Arena in the Tor-gardens of Umbar Baharbêl.\n9\tTalk to Ghâlim on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tGhâlim is on a terrace in the Tor-gardens of Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[2858]="70052782\n1\tDefeat Orcs in the Gladden Fields (total: 4)\030Defeat half-orcs in the Gladden Fields (total: 6)\tGandalf wants to meet you on the road north of Duskenvale, but first he has asked you to defeat Orcs and half-orcs in the Gladden Fields.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf on the road north of Duskenvale, near the Gladden Fields\tGandalf asked to meet you on the road north of Duskenvale, near the Gladden Fields.\n3\tMeet up with Gandalf further east along the road, in Laerlad\tGandalf desires to walk east along the road into Laerlad, where he will speak further on the subject of Isildur's journey north from Gondor.\n4\tTalk to Gandalf by the wooded road in Laerlad\tGandalf has called a halt along the wooded road in Laerlad.\n5\tGandalf has called a halt along the wooded road in Laerlad. He asked you to look at the surrounding countryside and consider the landscape Isildur would have seen as he rode north.\t\n6\tTalk to Gandalf by the wooded road in Laerlad\tGandalf has called a halt along the wooded road in Laerlad.\n7\tMeet up with Gandalf further north along the road by the Gladden Fields\tGandalf desires to walk north along the road beside the Gladden Fields, where he will speak further on the subject of Isildur's journey north from Gondor.\n8\tTalk to Gandalf beside the road\tGandalf has called a halt beside the road by the Gladden Fields.\n9\tGandalf has called a halt beside the road by the Gladden Fields. He asked you to look at the surrounding countryside and consider the terrain within which the Orcs attacked Isildur's company.\t\n10\tTalk to Gandalf beside the road\tGandalf has called a halt beside the road alongside the Gladden Fields.\n11\tMeet up with Gandalf by the river-bank, down the slope and to the north-west\tGandalf desires to meet you down the slope along the river-bank, further to the north-west.\n12\tTalk to Gandalf alongside the river-bank\tGandalf has called a halt along the river-bank in the Gladden Fields.\n13\tGandalf has called a halt alongside the river-bank. He asked you to look around you as Isildur must have done when he knew the end was near.\t\n14\tTalk to Gandalf alongside the river-bank\tGandalf has called a halt alongside the river-bank.\n",
[2859]="70059AD5\n1\tTalk to Durin and unravel the mystery of the long-forgotten chamber\tDurin contemplates the lifelike statue and the strange chamber in which it stands.\n2\tTalk to Durin in Mótsog's Tomb\tDurin stands in Mótsog's Tomb, shaken by what he has seen and experienced.\n",
[2860]="70059AF4\n1\tTalk to Mótsog and hear his account\tMótsog stands in a long-forgotten chamber deep below Gundabad.\n2\tTalk to Mótsog\tMótsog stands in a long-forgotten chamber deep below Gundabad.\n3\tTalk to Durin in Mótsog's Tomb\tDurin stands in Mótsog's Tomb deep beneath Gundabad.\n",
[2861]="70052783\n1\tMeet Gandalf on Tol Send, a small island in the Anduin to the west\tGandalf has pointed out an island in the Anduin to the west, declaring that the end of Isildur's story can there be told.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf on Tol Send\tGandalf waits on the island of Tol Send, ready to conclude the story of Isildur and his loss of the Ring.\n3\tGandalf asked you to look around you while standing on the isle of Tol Send, as Isildur must have done after swimming across the river.\t\n4\tTalk to Gandalf on Tol Send\tGandalf waits on the island of Tol Send, ready to conclude the story of Isildur and his loss of the Ring.\n",
[2862]="7006B561\n1\tTalk to Caebar on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tSuitably chastened by the words of his instructor, Caebar wishes to do what he can to help you learn about the lands into which you must travel.\n2\tTalk to Ghâlim on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tGhâlim is in the Tor-gardens, instructing you about the lands of Shagâna.\n3\tRetrieve a jar of clean water for Ghâlim from the fountain down the stairs to the east of the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tA jar of clean water can be found down the stairs to the east of the terrace in the Tor-gardens.\n4\tReturn to Ghâlim with the jar of clean water\tGhâlim stands on the terrace in the Tor-gardens, waiting for you to return with the jar of water he requested.\n5\tWait for Ghâlim to speak\tKeeping his eyes upon you, Ghâlim slowly upends the jar. Water spills out onto the ground until the jar is empty.\n6\tTalk to Ghâlim on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tGhâlim has wasted the clean water you brought to him in service of making a point.\n7\tTalk to Caebar on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tCaebar wishes to do what he can to help you learn about the lands into which you must travel.\n8\tTalk to Ghâlim on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tGhâlim is on the terrace in the Tor-gardens.\n9\tTalk to Caebar on the terrace in the Tor-gardens\tCaebar is on the terrace in the Tor-gardens.\n",
[2863]="70052785\n1\tTalk to Adalfon at the village of Hultvís\tAdalfon at the village of Hultvís may have a request for you.\n2\tCollect forest-hart flanks in Woodsedge (total: 3)\tAdalfon asked you to slay forest-harts in Woodsedge for their flanks, in order to help fill the hole left in the town's food-stores.\n3\tBring the flanks to Veremund by the cooking fires in Hultvís\tVeremund is by the cooking fires in the village of Hultvís.\n4\tTalk to Eurik in Hultvís\tEurik is in the village of Hultvís.\n5\tInvestigate the terrible apparition Eurik saw at the Old Ford\tEurik, a hunter from Hultvís, was frightened away from his prey by a terrible apparition at the Old Ford, located in the Wolf-denes north-west of the village.\n6\tTalk to Karazgar, but remain alert for treachery\tKarazgar stares at you, his eyes filled with malice.\n7\tTalk to Karazgar and learn of his request\tKarazgar stands by the Old Ford. He has declared that he means you no harm, but wishes only to speak with you.\n8\tTalk to Gandalf outside the Beorninghús\tGandalf stands with Elrond outside the Beorninghús.\n",
[2864]="7006B562\n1\tTalk to Hármelak in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja\tYou should speak with Hármelak about the status of the preparations. The Golden Queen is inside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja.\n2\tTalk to Belondor in Dâr Laja\030Talk to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja\030Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja\tHármelak has asked you to speak with the other members of the Kindred of the Coins in Dâr Laja.\n3\tMeet with your companions at the east gate of the city\tWith preparations for the journey delayed or otherwise obstructed, the Kindred has suggested that you gather at the east gate of the city and form an advance travelling party.\n4\tTalk to Sirgon by the east gate of Umbar Baharbêl\tSirgon is by the east gate of the city.\n5\tTalk to Belondor by the east gate of Umbar Baharbêl\tBelondor is by the east gate of the city.\n",
[2865]="70059AF8\n1\tTalk to Mótsog and hear the rest of his tale\tMótsog stands in a chamber far below Gundabad.\n2\tTalk to Mótsog\tMótsog stands in a long-forgotten chamber deep beneath Gundabad.\n",
[2866]="7006B585\n1\tJourney to the guard-post east of Umbar Baharbêl\tThe first step of your journey lies to the east of the city, along the Road of Riches, at the guard-post Belondor suggested.\n2\tTalk to Khashig at the guard-post east of Umbar Baharbêl\tKhashig is at his guard-post east of the city.\n3\tDefeat stinging sand-flies east of the city for Khashig (total: 6)\tSand-flies can be found in the vicinity of Khashig's guard-post, east of Umbar Baharbêl.\n4\tTalk to Khashig at the guard-post east of the city\tKhashig is at his guard-post east of the city.\n5\tTalk to Corudan at the guard-post east of the city\tCorudan is at the guard-post east of the city.\n6\tJourney east to the guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall\tThe next step of your journey lies further to the east, by the ruins of Telperiën's Wall.\n7\tTalk to Hûta at the guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall\tHûta is at his guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall.\n8\tPatrol northward along Telperiën's Wall\030Retrieve fallen stones along Telperiën's Wall (total: 8)\tHûta asked you to patrol northward and retrieve stones that have fallen from the wall.\n9\tBring the fallen stones to Hûta at his guard-post by Telperiën's Wall\tHûta is at his guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall.\n10\tTalk to Belondor at the guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall\tBelondor is at the guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall.\n11\tTalk to Hûta at his guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall\tHûta is at his guard-post beside Telperiën's Wall.\n12\tFind the west entrance to the village of Iridír, in Ambarûl\tHûta gave you directions to the village of Iridír in Ambarûl, east of Telperiën's Wall.\n13\tTalk to Rahâzi at the entrance of Iridír\tRahâzi stops in her tracks as you seek to enter the village of Iridír.\n",
[2867]="7005278C\n1\tTalk to Elrond at the Beorninghús\030Talk to Glorfindel at the Beorninghús\030Talk to Arwen at the Beorninghús\tElrond, Arwen, and Glorfindel have come to the Beorninghús on their journey to Gondor.\n2\tTalk to Grimbeorn\tGrimbeorn is waiting to speak with you about the many new arrivals at his home.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf inside the Beorninghús\tGandalf has gone back inside the Beorninghús to study the Black Book of Mordor.\n",
[2868]="70059AF6\n1\tTalk to Durin in Mótsog's Tomb\tDurin stands in a long-forgotten chamber beneath Gundabad, clearly confused by the words of Mótsog.\n2\tTalk to Durin and hear his remembrance\tDurin looks at you with realization dawning in his eyes.\n3\tTalk to Mótsog\tMótsog stands in a long-forgotten chamber deep beneath Gundabad.\n",
[2869]="7006B589\n1\tWait for Rahâzi to depart the village\tRahâzi runs into the wild, leaving you to speak to her mother Girhâzi.\n2\tFind Girhâzi within the lodge inside the village of Iridír\tAccording to Rahâzi, her mother Girhâzi will be interested in speaking with you within her lodge to the south.\n3\tTalk to Girhâzi inside her lodge within Iridír\tGirhâzi is inside her lodge in the village of Iridír, in Ambarûl.\n4\tTalk to Belondor inside Girhâzi's lodge within Iridír\tBelondor is in Girhâzi's lodge within the village of Iridír.\n5\tTalk to Girhâzi inside her lodge within Iridír\tGirhâzi is inside her lodge within the village of Iridír, in Ambarûl.\n6\tTalk to Rahâzi at the insect den of Gurakhu, north-west of Iridír\tRahâzi was sent to the insect den of Gurakhu, north-west of Iridír, and now her mother Girhâzi wants you to help with her assigned task.\n7\tCollect zizanu bristles for Rahâzi (total: 6)\tRahâzi has asked you to collect the bristles she was sent to retrieve from the insects at Gurakhu, west of Iridír. In the interest of continued collaboration, you should do what you can to help Girhâzi's daughter.\n8\tBring the zizanu bristles to Rahâzi at Gurakhu\tRahâzi is at Gurakhu, north-west of Iridír, waiting for you to return to her with her task complete.\n9\tTalk to Surdûsha at Gurakhu\tRahâzi's fellow Dumûri warrior, Surdûsha, is at Gurakhu, north-west of Iridír.\n10\tTalk to Rahâzi at Gurakhu\tRahâzi is at Gurakhu in Ambarûl.\n",
[2870]="7006B58A\n1\tFind the camp of the Ordâkhai to the north-east of Iridír\030Defeat Ordâkhai warriors throughout Ambarûl (total: 6)\tOrdâkhai remnants gather at a war-camp to the north-east of Iridír, in Ambarûl.\n2\tTalk to Surdûsha outside Omboha\tSurdûsha keeps a watchful eye on Omboha.\n3\tFind Rahâzi to the north of Omboha\tSurdûsha told you that Rahâzi pursued fleeing Ordâkhai warriors to the north.\n4\tTalk to Rahâzi outside the grove of Arwáth\tRahâzi pursued the Ordâkhai to the outskirts of the grove of Arwáth.\n5\tPick up the weapon of the slain Ordâkhai\030Search the body of the slain Ordâkhai warrior outside Arwáth\tOutside the grove of Arwáth, Rahâzi asked you to search her foes for signs of their purpose in Ambarûl.\n6\tPresent the items you found to Rahâzi outside the grove of Arwáth\tRahâzi is interested to examine the items you collected from the body of her foe.\n7\tVenture within the grove of Arwáth to the north\tRahâzi believes you should venture within the grove of Arwáth and ensure that no Ordâkhai hide within.\n8\tTalk to Shanthar at Arwáth\tThe Elf-warden Shanthar stands within the grove of Arwáth.\n9\tListen for the faded Kintai in the grove of Arwáth\030Stand in the grove of Arwáth beside one of the trees with red leaves\tShanthar suggested that you listen for the faded Kintai in the grove of Arwáth.\n10\tTalk to Shanthar at Arwáth\tThe Elf-warden Shanthar stands within the grove of Arwáth.\n11\tTalk to Rahâzi outside the grove of Arwáth\tRahâzi is on the outskirts of the grove of Arwáth.\n",
[2871]="70021E8F\n1\tCollect blood-marks from Dunlendings in Fordirith (total: 8)\030Recover weapons from fallen Uch-lûth clansmen (total: 4)\tDeserters can be found north of Echad Dagoras, in Fordirith. Wadu has asked you to recover blood-marks from the Dunlending deserters in Fordirith and to recover the weapons of his fallen kinsmen.\n2\tBring blood-marks and Dunlending weapons to Wadu at Echad Dagoras\tWadu is at Echad Dagoras, the camp of the Grey Company in Fordirith, Enedwaith. You have collected blood-marks and weapons from fallen Uch-lûth and should bring them to Wadu as he requested.\n3\tTalk to Lothrandir at Echad Dagoras\tLothrandir is at Echad Dagoras, in Fordirith, northern Enedwaith. You have pleased Wadu with your heroics on his behalf among the Dunlending deserters and should tell Lothrandir of your successes.\n",
[2872]="70025394\n1\tTalk to Radanir and walk the Forsaken Road\tRadanir is at the camp-site of the Grey Company in the grove of trees east of Lhanuch. You should speak with Radanir when you are ready to walk the Forsaken Road in search of information that may allow Aragorn to compel the Oath-breakers to fulfil their oath.\n2\tTalk to Halbarad in Lhanuch\tHalbarad is among the huts on the western side of Lhanuch. Halbarad is waiting to speak with you after the disaster of the Forsaken Road.\n",
[2873]="7005A724\n1\tCollect meats for the feast (total: 8)\030Collect vegetables for the feast (total: 8)\030Collect plates for the feast (total: 8)\030Collect utensils for the feast (total: 8)\tVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset. You should collect wares and provisions for the feast.\n2\tTalk to Prince Ingór\tVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset. Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.\n3\tTalk to Prince Ingór\tVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset. Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.\n",
[2874]="700135D2\n1\tTalk to Wafi\tWafi is in the Forging Hall of Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin. Hundi has told you to show your new weapon to Wafi in Thorin's Hall. Wafi will be able to help determine the intrinsic characteristics of the weapon.\n2\tBring the weapon to the Forge-master to be identified\tRósar the Forge-master is in the Forging Hall in Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin. He has the skill to identify the mysterious weapon you have acquired. Wafi has instructed you to have Rósar the Forge-master identify your weapon so that you may understand its strength and potential.\n3\tEquip your new weapon\tNow that your weapon has been identified, you must equip it if you wish it to enhance its worth.\n4\tTalk to Wafi\tWafi is in the Forging Hall of Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin. Rósar the Forge-master has identified your weapon, and you should now show it to Wafi.\n5\tSlot a Setting Relic in your weapon\tWafi is in the Forging Hall of Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin. Wafi has asked you to slot one of the Relics to your weapon in order to further customise its abilities.\n6\tTalk to Wafi\tWafi is in the Forging Hall of Thorin's Hall in Ered Luin. Wafi has asked you to slot one of the Relics you have to your weapon in order to further customise its abilities, and is now waiting to speak with you.\n",
[2875]="700135D3\n1\tTalk to Dithalion by the forges in Rivendell\tDithalion is by the forges in Rivendell. Hundi bid you to show your new weapon to Dithalion, an Elf of Rivendell who will be able to help you make use of your weapon.\n2\tTalk to Dithalion by the forges in Rivendell\tDithalion is at the Forges of Rivendell.\n3\tTalk to Dithalion by the forges in Rivendell\tDithalion is at the Forges of Rivendell. You have inscribed a tracery into your weapon and should now speak with Dithalion.\n",
[2876]="7001B5C4\n1\tTalk to Laeglang in Gathbúrz\030Talk to Lamwen in Gathbúrz\030Talk to Súlthel in Gathbúrz\tLaeglang, Lamwen, and Súlthel are somewhere in Gathbúrz, east of Ost Galadh and outside the walls of Dol Guldur. Gruingalas has told you to recall the scouts that are keeping watch on the fortress of Dol Guldur in Gathbúrz.\n2\tTalk to Gruingalas at Ost Galadh\tGruingalas is outside the entrance to Gadorgar, in Ost Galadh. You have recalled the scouts from Gathbúrz and should return to Gruingalas with the news they gathered in the wild.\n3\tTalk to Gruingalas and meet with the Hidden Guard\tGruingalas is in Ost Galadh, waiting to speak with you. The mission of the Hidden Guard is at its end: the time has come to exchange Mazog for the dwarf prisoners.\n4\tTalk to Gruingalas at Ost Galadh\tGruingalas is outside the entrance to Gadorgar, in Ost Galadh. The exchange did not go according to plan, and the mission of the Hidden Guard has ended in failure: Achardor is dead, Mazog is taken, and Bori remains in captivity.\n",
[2877]="7006B5D5\n1\tExamine the dead man by Sigileth and Silirtis in Khûd Zagin\tSigileth has asked you to examine the dead man to discover what spelled his end.\n2\tTalk to Sigileth in southern Khûd Zagin\tSigileth is in southern Khûd Zagin.\n3\tOffer water to the dying man in southern Khûd Zagin\tThe man is barely alive, but a gift of water may help bring him back from death's brink.\n4\tReturn her water bladder to Sigileth\tYou have done what you can for the dying man, and should give Sigileth's water bladder back to her.\n5\tTalk to Silirtas by the dying man\tSilirtas stands in southern Khûd Zagin by the dying man.\n6\tWait for Silirtas to depart\tSilirtas hurries away.\n7\tTalk to Sigileth in southern Khûd Zagin\tSigileth stands by the dying man in southern Khûd Zagin.\n8\tReturn to Tharashil in south-western Shonith\tSigileth believes the dying man can be saved, but if he is to recover at Shonith you will need Tharashil's permission.\n9\tTalk to Tharashil in south-western Shonith\tTharashil is on the leader's rise in south-western Shonith.\n10\tFind Balakhâd behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith\tBalakhâd is behind the pavilions to the north of the water in Shonith.\n11\tTalk to Balakhâd in Shonith\tBalakhâd is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n",
[2878]="7006B5DA\n1\tTalk to Silirtas in Shonith\tSilirtas stands by Balakhâd at Shonith, in Khûd Zagin.\n2\tTalk to Balakhâd in Shonith\tBalakhâd is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n3\tTalk to Sigileth in Shonith\tSigileth is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n4\tTalk to Balakhâd in Shonith\tBalakhâd is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n5\tTalk to Balakhâd and listen to what befell him at Nirgambâr\tBalakhâd is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n6\tTalk to Balakhâd in Shonith\tBalakhâd is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n7\tTalk to Sigileth in Shonith\tSigileth is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n8\tTalk to Silirtas in Shonith\tSilirtas is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n9\tTalk to Balakhâd in Shonith\tBalakhâd is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n10\tTalk to Silirtas in Shonith\tSilirtas is behind the pavilions north of the water in Shonith.\n",
[2879]="700537B5\n1\tTalk to Elrond outside the Beorninghús\tElrond is outside the Beorninghús. Gandalf asked you to bring Elrond word of his intent to speak with the shade of Isildur, and his desire that Elrond and Glorfindel accompany the two of you to Tol Send.\n2\tTalk to Glorfindel outside the Beorninghús\tGlorfindel is outside the Beorninghús. Gandalf and Elrond wish for you to ask Glorfindel to go with you to Tol Send, there to speak with the shade of Isildur about several matters of import.\n3\tMeet up with Gandalf, Elrond, and Glorfindel on Tol Send in the Gladden Fields\tGandalf, Elrond, and Glorfindel wish to meet you on Tol Send, the Isle of the Flowers in the Gladden Fields.\n4\tTalk to Gandalf on Tol Send\tGandalf, Elrond, and Glorfindel have come to Tol Send, where they await an audience with the shade of Isildur.\n5\tTalk to the shade of Isildur on Tol Send\tThe shade of Isildur is on Tol Send, in the Gladden Fields.\n",
[2880]="7006B593\n1\tRestock your supplies using Girhâzi's provided foodstuffs\030Restock your supplies using Girhâzi's provided water\tThe food and water Girhâzi has provided for your travelling party can be found at the entrance of the village.\n2\tTalk to Khôltekh at the village entrance of Iridír\tKhôltekh is at the village entrance of Iridír.\n3\tWait for the new arrival\tSomeone approaches at a run.\n4\tTalk to Rahâzi at the village entrance of Iridír\tRahâzi has arrived at the entrance of her village.\n5\tTalk to Rothog at the village entrance of Iridír\tRothog has something to say.\n6\tTalk to Belondor at the village entrance of Iridír\tBelondor also has something to say to you.\n7\tTake the road south into Khûd Zagin from Ambarûl\tThe time has come for your travelling party to take the road south into Khûd Zagin.\n8\tTalk to Corudan along the road into Khûd Zagin\tCorudan stands beside the road leading south into Khûd Zagin.\n9\tDefeat hunting birds in Khûd Zagin (total: 4)\030Defeat jackals or servals in Khûd Zagin (total: 6)\030Defeat lizards or snakes in Khûd Zagin (total: 2)\tCorudan has suggested that you defeat the birds, jackals or servals, and lizards or snakes that threaten your southward journey into Khûd Zagin.\n10\tTalk to Belondor by the road that runs from Ambarûl into Khûd Zagin\tBelondor stands beside the road that runs from Ambarûl into Khûd Zagin.\n",
})
